        "text_qhVPVK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Support System also brings forward his long term vision, a desire to build success while lifting others along the way. He resists gatekeeping, choosing instead to create opportunities that echo the spirit of the Windrush generation, believing that true longevity comes when your community remains intact.<br/><br/>The Support System stands as both a portrait and a statement. It reminds us that behind every artist there are people, relationships, and values that make the journey possible. For Benji Flow, that system is built on love, faith, resilience, and the kind of support that lasts beyond the stage.</p>"
          }
        }
